<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS - Colt, Ecomat.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS - Colt, Ecomat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colt Telecom Group Plc's American depositary shares (ADS) were trading at 20-1/2 in the early afternoon of their first session.</p>
<p>The issue opened at 21-3/8, up from their IPO price of $18.10.</p>
<p>Of a total offering of 26.7 million shares, 13.35 million shares were offered in the United States and Canada, with four shares represented by one ADS.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley was lead manager for the offering.</p>
<p>London-based Colt provides local telecommunications services in England and Germany.</p>
</text>
